{
  "id": "asoxLibThWriteBk",
  "name": "lib-thehive-writeback",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## lib-thehive-writeback (N8N-2.2)\n**Trigger:** called by playbooks through Execute Workflow, waiting for the result.\n**Inputs:** `{thehive_alert_id, wazuh_alert_id, config, context: {playbook, n8n_execution_id}, actions: [text]}`.\n**Actions taken:** comments on the TheHive alert: first line `[asox-n8n writeback] wazuh-alert-id=<id>`, then playbook, n8n execution id and the actions taken. Idempotent: if a comment by n8n@asox.local with that first line exists, nothing is written. Failures go to lib-error (parked).\n**Systems changed:** TheHive (one comment on the alert).\n**Approval:** not needed (no system changes outside TheHive).\n**Owner:** n8n.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "4bc7a11b-6973-52c3-b5bc-c40a14852c71",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "c4ab9489-d1fe-5ea3-a66d-6dd0ff5b589f",
      "name": "Called by a workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.THEHIVE_URL }}/api/v1/query",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "theHiveProjectApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: [ { _name: 'getAlert', idOrName: $json.thehive_alert_id }, { _name: 'comments' }, { _name: 'page', from: 0, to: 500 } ] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "60e0fbdb-381a-583b-83cf-58fc6299e55a",
      "name": "List TheHive comments",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "theHiveProjectApi": {
          "id": "asoxTheHiveApi01",
          "name": "TheHive API (n8n)"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// A writeback exists when a comment's first line is exactly the marker line\n// and its author is n8n's account (lib-config), not by fuzzy text.\nconst r = $input.first().json;\nconst input = $('Called by a workflow').first().json;\nconst wb = input.config.writeback;\nconst firstLine = `${wb.marker} wazuh-alert-id=${input.wazuh_alert_id}`;\nif (r.statusCode !== 200 || !Array.isArray(r.body)) {\n  return [{ json: { status: 'failed', http_status: r.statusCode, stage: 'List TheHive comments',\n    message: `HTTP ${r.statusCode}: ${JSON.stringify(r.body)}`.slice(0, 1000) } }];\n}\nconst existing = r.body.find((cm) => (cm.createdBy ?? cm._createdBy) === wb.author\n  && typeof cm.message === 'string' && cm.message.split('\\n')[0] === firstLine);\nif (existing) return [{ json: { status: 'already', comment_id: existing._id } }];\nconst lines = [\n  firstLine,\n  '',\n  `n8n playbook **${input.context.playbook}**, execution ${input.context.n8n_execution_id}.`,\n  '',\n  'Actions taken:',\n  ...input.actions.map((a) => `- ${a}`),\n];\nreturn [{ json: { status: 'write', message: lines.join('\\n') } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "ab0f91f8-0af4-5be5-ac1c-9b31d19a7649",
      "name": "Check existing writeback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "65b3a3f2-6ec8-5a92-81e9-42a0d7d6c1aa",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status === 'write' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
